<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμᾰρύσσω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰμ]</span>, 
			Ep.
		, only pres. and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sparkle, twinkle, glance,</i> of
			the eye, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ δέ οἱ ὄσσων πῦρ ἀμάρυσσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					827
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκνόν</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύκν᾽ ἀμαρύσσων</span>
			<i>darting</i> quick <i>glances,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				278
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φολίδων στικτοῖσιτύποις ἀμάρυσσεν
					ὀφίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					18.79
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, of light, colour, etc., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.178
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1146
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαρύσσεται ἄνθεσι λειμών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.668
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Marian.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				5.77
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>shoot forth, dart,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					415
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				8.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dazzle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				5.485
			</span></i>.</div>
